From 2487abfbac42e4d7c4e459e66e3fd860670d754e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@local>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:53:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 061/547] Fix the app freezing when opening a song's details
 dialog

The view-count fetch added in the details dialog ran straight from
LaunchedEffect's default (main-thread) dispatcher. Every other caller
of playerResponseForMetadata is already inside a background coroutine
by the time it gets there, so the function itself never needed to hop
to IO - called directly from the UI thread, its network and signature
work ran there instead and froze the whole app for as long as that
took, sometimes long enough to look like a hang. Wrap the call in
withContext(Dispatchers.IO).
