From 7beb579012a2eae2708d7b25b14aa489b6f1b991 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 16:24:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 064/547] Remove the Discord presence entirely while paused
 instead of showing a paused card

Superseded the earlier omit-timestamps fix: a paused/stopped player now calls stopActivity() immediately (same as no media loaded), rather than sending a 'Paused' card with a frozen layout. Removes the now-meaningless auto-clear-after-pause timer and setting along with it, since there's nothing left for it to clear.
