From 625d30c4587ba3679997a553b33d0ac3efbbbf85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yuuichi <6133780+yuuichi-s@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 17:37:53 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 085/547] fix: prevent concurrent home pagination requests

Set the loading flag only when no home pagination request is already running. Perform the check and update as a single operation so that simultaneous load-more requests start only one network call.

Always clear the loading flag when the request finishes or is cancelled so that later load-more requests can proceed.

(cherry picked from commit 84b4fd4f7c4439bfd1f2ac1d5d7c245a08b79784)
