Subject: [PATCH 112/547] Stop battery saver from overriding word-by-word
 lyrics sync

LyricKaraokeEnable is the person's own choice to turn word-by-word sync on;
karaokeEnabled additionally required !context.isPowerSaver(), so battery
saver silently dropped the display back to line-by-line highlighting
regardless of that choice, with nothing in the UI to say why. The word
sweep just redraws an already-decoded line every frame - no extra network
or decode work over the line-by-line highlighter it replaces - so there
isn't a real battery cost distinct from the fallback it was being swapped
for. The setting alone decides now.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
