CI: "Argument type mismatch: actual type is 'String?', but 'String' was
expected" at mergeDatabaseFile's liveDbPath argument. SupportSQLiteDatabase.path
is typed String? - the pre-existing FileInputStream(...path) calls elsewhere
never caught this because Java constructors are platform types Kotlin
doesn't null-check, but mergeDatabaseFile is a Kotlin function with a
non-null String parameter, which does get checked.
---
