identical: "Index: 1, Size: 1" from Collections$SingletonList.get.

The innertubex adapter reported mimeType straight through as, typically,
a bare "audio/mp4". This app's format handling assumes YouTube's own
combined header - audio/mp4; codecs="mp4a.40.2" - and recovers the codec
