Subject: [PATCH 223/547] Show the downloaded pin on a playlist row, which
 nothing could reach

The badge block opened with PlaylistIcon, marked as always shown, then
returned early unless showBadges was set - and the downloaded pin sat
below that return. showBadges defaults to false and not one of the
fourteen call sites passes true, so a fully downloaded playlist never
showed the pin anywhere in the app. The grid variant, which has no such
gate, showed it correctly all along, which is why this looked like it
worked in some places.

Moved above the gate. Downloaded is a fact about the playlist rather than
a detail of the screen showing it, which is the same reason PlaylistIcon
sits there. The edit and local-storage icons genuinely are per-screen
decoration and stay behind it.

