From be6675bc3c9927c355210522de1efcff4623c1f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@l>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:41:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 230/547] Reconcile an album's artist credits against its
 tracks

"View album" showed the right album under the wrong artist, and stayed that
way. backfillAlbumArtists returned early whenever the album already had
credits, so it only ever filled in blanks - it never corrected one. The
album's credits come from YouTube's album page and can point at a Topic
channel or at the other spelling of a channel id, and nothing reconciled
them against the song credits this class had just repaired. So the song was
right, the album was wrong, and the album was the one the album page linked
from.

The album's credits are now rewritten from the artists all its tracks agree
on. Two guards keep this from inventing anything: it only acts when the
tracks unanimously share an artist, and it only rewrites when the album and
its tracks already name the same artists and merely disagree about which
channel that is. Where the names genuinely differ this is a compilation, a
collaboration or a label credit and the album's own answer is the better
one, so it is left alone and the disagreement logged.

Verified by compiling coreRelease.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../com/dd3boh/outertune/db/daos/AlbumsDao.kt |  5 +++
 .../outertune/utils/ArtistCreditEnricher.kt   | 34 +++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/db/daos/AlbumsDao.kt b/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/db/daos/AlbumsDao.kt
index c8e8fc389..d0da9a6d6 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/db/daos/AlbumsDao.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/db/daos/AlbumsDao.kt
@@ -323,6 +323,11 @@ interface AlbumsDao : ArtistsDao {
     """)
     fun deleteCollidingAlbumArtistMaps(oldId: String, newId: String)
 
+    /** Drops every artist credit on one album, so it can be rewritten from its tracks. */
+    @Transaction
+    @Query("DELETE FROM album_artist_map WHERE albumId = :albumId")
+    fun unlinkAlbumArtists(albumId: String)
+
     @Transaction
     @Query("DELETE FROM song_artist_map WHERE songId = :songID")
     fun unlinkSongArtists(songID: String)
diff --git a/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/utils/ArtistCreditEnricher.kt b/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/utils/ArtistCreditEnricher.kt
