From 631e898583ac7b491ddf2810a33f61f347406779 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 16:48:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 311/547] desktop: audit what the phone has that this does not

Walked the Android ui/screens tree against the desktop module and wrote
down every feature with a status and, where it is missing, what it would
actually take. Four states: done, partial, planned with a known shape,
or deliberately not planned with a reason.

Two things it surfaced that were not obvious from either side alone:
there is no settings screen at all, which is quietly blocking half a
dozen toggles that are currently decisions made on the user's behalf;
and the signed-in session still powers nothing, so four working sign-in
routes buy no home feed, no recommendations and no server playlists.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 desktop/PARITY.md | 119 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 119 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 desktop/PARITY.md

diff --git a/desktop/PARITY.md b/desktop/PARITY.md
new file mode 100644
