Subject: [PATCH 372/547] Desktop: smooth word-by-word lyrics, estimated word
 timings, fonts, stats data

- Lyrics follow a per-frame position between the player's uneven reports, so word fades no longer step.
- Line-synced lyrics get word timings from the phone's syllable/punctuation estimator (ported).
- Lyrics size and alignment settings.
- Any installed system font for the whole app; text size; pure black; start section.
- play_event table (schema 7) records every play for Stats; seeded from history.
- 'Keep listening history' is now actually honoured.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
