From 53d86bf53806c187bdd53b148c469e6cf46cb5c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:23:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 373/547] Desktop: settings by category with search, Stats,
 Android-style Home and artist pages

- Settings split into the phone's categories beside a list, with a search over every setting; dropdowns and sliders replace inline radio lists and dials. Font picker over all installed fonts; text size, pure black, start section, hide explicit, lyrics size/alignment, clear history, About.
- Stats section: plays, songs, listening time, top artists and songs over week/month/year/all time.
- Home in the phone's order: mood chips, Quick picks, Keep listening, Forgotten favourites, Liked, then the feed.
- Artist page: photo header with Play/Shuffle and bio, top five songs with an arrow to all of them, carousels for albums, singles and EPs, videos and the rest, each opening its full list.
- Hide explicit applies to search, Home and artist pages.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
