Subject: [PATCH 374/547] Android: Equalizer settings holds settings only

The bands, tone dials and compressor were a second copy of the player panel, and the screen kept its own snapshot of the curve - so changing anything there wrote a stale curve over what had been set in the player. The controls stay in the panel; this screen reads the live value.

