Subject: [PATCH 381/547] Fix backup import speed and the lyrics offset
 controls

- Desktop backup import runs as one transaction: a 5,729-song phone backup went from most of an hour (one disk flush per row, holding the database so the window seemed frozen) to seconds.
- Android CounterDialog: Reset now resets the value shown (Reset then OK used to save the old value back); the value label has a fixed width so the slider no longer resizes under the finger; values snap to a step (10 ms for the lyrics offset). Fixes the lyrics offset, lyrics font size and prefetch dialogs.
- Desktop lyrics offset is applied on display instead of re-fetching on every slider step; Reset buttons on the offset and text size sliders.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
