From 3c596000ebb7328301eb0455cfe5609503bbc47c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:52:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 382/547] Android: Equaliser Studio and settings search

- Equaliser Studio (Settings > Player > Equalizer > Equaliser Studio): pick any song, loop it whole or between marked A/B points, switch Tuned/Original in place, start from the current EQ or any preset or profile, edit bands, tone, balance and compressor, then save as a profile or apply to the player. Plays through a private ExoPlayer (MusicService.createStudioPlayer) sharing the stream/cache resolver but with its own equaliser and no stats, history, session or audio focus; the main player is paused, never touched otherwise.
- Settings search at the top of Settings: 162 settings across 18 screens, indexed from each screen's own titles so it matches what is on screen in any language; a result opens its screen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
