From 0a03d1e69e8c5a97a29dfc36c1f692fc28b2e4e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:03:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 383/547] Desktop: exact Android icons, phone history in Stats,
 queue handle and lyrics controls

- Every icon is now the phone's exact shape: the app's own drawables where it has them, Material Rounded otherwise, generated by IconGenerator (test-only dependency, nothing shipped). The artificial rounding stroke is gone.
- Backup import brings the phone's play history (event table) into Stats and Recently played, plus song lengths; repeat imports add nothing twice; older backups without a duration column still import.
- Docked queue handle: a sideways arrow with the queue name beside it, and a Show queue title setting.
- Lyrics view: close and a menu with timing offset (with reset) and Fetch lyrics again.
- Reset beside a settings slider no longer grows the row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
