- "X & Y" that is not itself an artist is split into whichever halves are
- Every answer is cached (artist_link, schema 10), including "no such artist" for a month, and
  credits are rewritten from the cache on every write, so rescans and re-syncs keep the links
- Artist page: "Find on YouTube Music…" to link by hand, "Unlink" to undo a wrong match
- Runs after each folder scan and as each song starts playing

