From ab9966853ffc553bf1256c92c5a742b9ba3023e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:43:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 402/547] Shareable settings profiles on both apps

Export a profile choosing any of Appearance, Player, Equaliser, Lyrics and Playback; import one
choosing which of its parts to apply. Stats, history, likes, playlists, accounts, folders and
tokens are never included.

One file format (.otprofile, JSON) on Android and desktop: each category carries the settings both
apps share under common names - so a phone profile sets up the desktop and the other way round -
plus the creating app's own settings exactly as stored, so it restores completely where it was
made. Android: Settings > Backup & restore. Desktop: Settings > Privacy & backup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
