From 0c59285f44ee27d8487a48b65d29ed6324bcfc3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:51:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 404/547] Desktop: remappable keyboard shortcuts, several keys
 per action

Play/pause (Space, K), next/previous (Ctrl+arrows, Shift+N/P), seek (arrows), volume and mute,
shuffle (S), repeat (R), like (L), equaliser (E), lyrics (Y), queue (Q), open/close the player
(F), back (Esc), search (Ctrl+F, /), sleep timer (T). Settings > Keyboard: add any number of keys
to an action by pressing them, remove one, reset one or all; a key given to one action leaves any
other. Handled for the whole window, so they work in the full player too, and never while typing.
Shortcuts travel in settings profiles (Player).

