From 40015f62f99bb4011b2d7ae7fe89b1e477d9d92f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:20:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 406/547] Desktop: fix the bar showing the previous song after
 closing the full player

The full player returned early from App, ahead of the app's start-up effects, so opening it took
them out of composition and closing it ran them all again - and the one that restores the saved
queue replaced the live queue with the last session's. The bar (and the player, reopened) then
showed a different song from the one playing. The full player now comes after every effect.

Also: the Windows media flyout clears the previous cover when the new song has no web artwork.

