From 1323905e06a4a8c4de4a34fe9afbae9062110217 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:02:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 416/547] Layout editor: the queue handle stays on the bottom
 edge in free placement

It is the bottom sheet's peek, which the phone keeps at the bottom whatever the layout says; free
placement was seeding it under the controls like a movable block.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/layout-editor.html | 11 +++++++++++
