+/*
+ * The phone player, in dp, exactly as Player.kt lays it out - measured against the real thing on a
+ * 1080x2400 / 420dpi emulator, to the pixel. Both the guided and the free previews are drawn from
+ * these numbers, and free placement starts from the guided rects, so switching modes moves nothing
+ * and the phone draws an imported layout where this preview shows it.
+ *
+ *   status bar | equaliser handle (64) | cover, centred in what is left | title row (52)
+ *   | progress (slider 48, times 16, 12 under) | transport (72) | 24 | queue peek (48 x 1.2) | nav bar
+ */
