MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- The suggestions panel closed whenever focus left the box - which clicking anything in it does -
  so nothing in it could be clicked. It now has its own open state: opened by focusing or
  typing, closed by Escape, a search, opening a result, or a click outside the box and panel.
- The player's ⋮ opened a plain dropdown. It now opens the same rounded, animated panel of tiles
  as a song row's ⋮ (MenuPanel, shared by both), below the button or above it when it is low in
  the window, growing out of the corner nearest the button.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
