From a3f32c4974918cfbae1f3b2bc5820569c4fc4f5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:16:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 425/547] Desktop: downloaded songs and lists show the phone's
 downloaded mark, and pressing it removes them
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Material's OfflinePin, as the Android app draws it, replaces the download arrow once something is
saved: on song rows' quick button, in the ⋮ panels (song and player), on the player's download
button, and on a playlist or album's Download button once every song in it is saved. Pressing it
removes the download - for a list, every song in it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
