From a533e43c9e1892bce5ac5334e340e7a095c9aa93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:45:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 429/547] Desktop: no foreign key failure caching lyrics for
 songs not yet in the library

Lyrics are fetched as a song starts, which for a search result or radio pick is before anything has
written its song row, so caching them failed the lyrics table's foreign key. They are now cached
only for songs the library knows, and fetched again otherwise.

