From 0a8b0f6d7a6736559065be2935b53389d299a55a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:28:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 431/547] Desktop: next and previous still move with repeat-one
 on, as on the phone

Repeat-one looped the song for the next button as well as for the song ending, so the buttons did
nothing but restart it. Now only a song ending on its own loops; the buttons move through the queue
as if repeat were off - Media3's behaviour on the phone - and stop at either end, which only
repeat-all wraps.

