From 7fbd4b218074e2c68f44d9aa896cd524259ca4b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:16:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 461/547] Desktop: plays are recorded - Stats and history move
 again

A play is recorded once a share of the song has been heard, waited for with
snapshotFlow { player.positionMs.value to player.durationMs.value }. Those are StateFlows, not
Compose state, so snapshotFlow had nothing to track: it emitted once at the start of each song, at
zero, and the wait never ended. No play was ever written here - Stats only ever showed the plays a
phone backup had brought in, and the recently played list only ever grew from an import. The two
flows are combined directly now.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
