From 8f98a347d5282252e73b231b4227fa0c62a2f78a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:19:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 462/547] Desktop Playlists: Liked and Downloaded songs with
 the phone's icons, and a grid view
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- The phone's two automatic playlists, first in the list: Liked songs (the heart) and Downloaded
  songs (the cloud with an arrow), each on its icon tile as the phone draws them, opening their
  songs with Play and Shuffle.
- A grid view beside the list - the phone's view switch, remembered - every playlist a tile:
  saved ones with their cover, local ones and the automatic two with their icons.
- An empty playlist's hint pointed at the + button songs no longer have; it names the ⋮ menu.

