MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Most played and Extended charts showed the same ranking twice, at two lengths. One chart now,
  at the top, with its length chosen in the same row as how it ranks: Time listened / Times
  played | 20 · 50 · 100 · All. The artists row follows it (up to 100). Artists the longer chart
  reaches get their missing pictures fetched, as the extended one did.
- The period's plays and listening time under the title - "13,555 plays · 812h 4m" - from one
  query over the event table.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
