MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Both apps:
- Unliking shows a 10-second "Removed from liked songs · Undo" (one bar for several unliked
  together).
- Liking a song again - by Undo or any time that session - restores the time it was first liked,
  so it goes back where it was in Liked songs instead of to the top.
- Likes and unlikes reach YouTube Music a minute late; changed back inside that minute, nothing is
  sent and the account's list never moves. Anything still waiting is sent as the app goes to the
  background (Android) or closes (Windows).
Android: LikeSync, used by SongEntity.toggleLike/localToggleLike. Windows: LikePushes and
LibraryStore remembering unliked dates. RelikeOrderTest.

