The smoothed position reached the list as a number, so every visible line recomposed every frame -
rebuilding its style, modifiers and text sixty times a second for lines that had not changed. It is
passed as a read now: the current line comes from a derivedStateOf that changes once a line, and
only the line being sung reads the position each frame. Styles are built once per pane. Also, when
the browsing pause ends the list goes back to the line being sung, instead of waiting for the next
line change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
