did they had no karaoke sweep - the word-timing estimate was only applied to lyrics that came with
the song, so refetched, edited and searched lyrics went on screen without it until the lyrics were
closed and opened again. They pass through the same estimate now. While Refetch runs the lyrics show
the loading placeholder and the menu button a spinner, stopped however the fetch ends (it used to
