From 3be2e3bf4c9e3a6915b560492dd2add1d594eebe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:13:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 497/547] Lyrics: "no lyrics" looks again straight away, once a
 session

Both platforms kept a "no lyrics found" for a week without asking any provider, so a song whose
lyrics had since been added kept showing none. A recorded miss is now checked against the
providers again the first time it comes up in each session - the moment the app would show no
lyrics - and trusted for the rest of the session, so an instrumental is one lookup per session,
not one per play.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
