Subject: [PATCH 500/547] Desktop lyrics menu: edit, search and remove, as on
 the phone
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The lyrics ⋮ had only the timing offset and Fetch lyrics again. It now has the phone's other
lyrics options:
- Edit lyrics: the stored text, LRC or TTML as it came, in an editor; saved as this song's lyrics.
- Search lyrics: every candidate LRCLIB, KuGou and BetterLyrics have for a title and artist (both
  editable), each with its source, whether it is synced and its first lines; click one to use it.
- Remove lyrics: none for this song, and kept that way - unlike a miss, removed lyrics are not
  looked for again until fetched again by hand.
The edit icon is the phone's (Material Rounded Edit), generated like the rest.

