From fad28f34853fafc22701f25d633be3ae3778121e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:41:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 505/547] innertube: a default language YouTube accepts

The default locale took the JVM's full language tag, and YouTube refuses tags it does not list
("en-SG") with 400 Invalid argument on every request - which is why 11 of the live YouTube tests
failed on a machine set to English (Singapore). The bare language is used now ("en"). Neither app
is affected - both set their own - but the tests and any other caller were.

