From fdc331f749919a60f27e35b14e21df2be2359399 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:34:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 508/547] Android Stats: totals in two boxes, top artists first
 with their numbers

The period's plays and listening time were a small line under the title. They are two boxes under
the filters now - the desktop's tiles - and the one the chart is ranked by (time listened or times
played) is lit, so the boxes and the choice above them read as one thing.

Top artists come first, in one sideways row, each showing their own listening time or plays to
match the ranking (they used to show a song count, which is not what they were ranked by), then the
most played songs, then albums.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
