From 740adb96c3e3ce686bdecddcd06e4aa514096a88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 18:39:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 518/547] Lyrics providers: pick the mode first, then a list or
 a switch each

Provider selection comes first on both platforms. "In my order" shows one
list to tick and drag (the tabs list's look); "Automatic" asks every
provider at once and shows a switch per provider, since order does not
matter there. The desktop gains the automatic mode (first synced answer
wins, plain only when nobody has synced), a rounded lyrics menu, and
"Get lyrics from ..." to swap the current song to another provider.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
