Subject: [PATCH 530/547] Home stations play the whole station, not one song
 each

YouTube sends a station on the home page as its first song, with the
station's list as the playlist to play it in. The parser dropped that
playlist, so a station played as a song: one track, then the next
station's first, queued behind it from the same row. The playlist is kept
now - the phone already plays a home song through it - and the desktop
plays a station's list from the top.

