Subject: [PATCH 541/547] Shared client: album region retry and stations,
 narrowed; live detected

- An album is asked for again from the US only when YouTube answered with
  a page that had no album on it - not offline, on a timeout or when rate
  limited, where it only doubled the wait.
- Artist shuffles (RDAO) and a single song's radio (RDAMVM) are not
  stations: the same radio counted one way from a song's menu and the
  other from a home card.
- NewPipe extraction reports whether a video is live, and why it failed.

