From b43061b768c5e66d014b1268b3ca54096d209a1e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:00:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 543/547] Desktop: lighter while minimised and playing

Behind a minimised window the decode loop stops working things out for a
screen nobody sees: no spectrum analysis (an FFT a block, some forty a
second), and the position published four times a second instead of every
block, which kept the UI redrawing. The audio is processed as before.
The live probe also reports the audio path's CPU while playing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
