From 63c9bc2ad88a017d6569ca2971724b33233d47f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:30:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 545/547] Android: lyrics never show the previous song's

The player's lyrics were one flow of whatever was found last, untagged,
so moving to a song not yet fetched kept the old song's lyrics up until
the new one's arrived - or for good, when it had none. Lyrics now carry
the song they belong to: a song change shows the new one loading at once,
a lookup for the song just left is cancelled, and a refetch that finishes
after a skip is not shown under the next song.

