Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:42:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 546/547] Seek bar: Waves and Wave lines, on both apps

Samsung's media player look: three soft waves above a flat progress line,
nearly the same colour, each drifting at its own pace so they cross and
part, over the played part and fading into the line at its ends. "Waves"
draws them as solid overlapping shapes, "Wave lines" as fine lines a
shade apart. They swell while the song plays and settle into the line
when it is paused or dragged.

