From 6f40f0da6035ec5572443bf512dc916dc79b19a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:42:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 547/547] Artist pages: every artist of a song on the Songs
 shelf, not every other

A Songs-shelf row's artists were taken from runs already stripped of their
" & " separators and then thinned with oddElements() as if they were not,
keeping artists 1, 3, 5. "Song" by A & B on B's page read "A" - and
playing it from there stored it as A's alone; on the desktop, which
rewrites a song's credits on play, that wiped a correct "A, B" to "A".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
